<section id="contacto" class="border-y border-white/10 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#0c1621_0%,#09131c_100%)]">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:py-20">
      <div
        class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[36px] border border-white/10 px-8 py-16 shadow-[0_35px_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.32)] sm:px-12 sm:py-20"
        style={`background-image:
          linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(5, 11, 18, 0.84), rgba(5, 11, 18, 0.56)),
          url('/images/cta-banner.jpg');
          background-size: cover;
          background-position: center;`}
      >
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <span class="section-kicker text-slate-200">CTA final</span>
          <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl">
            ¿Qué esperas para comenzar un nuevo proyecto con Etapel?
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-200">
            Conservamos el cierre comercial de la home actual con una llamada a la acción más elegante, más respirada y mucho más convincente.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="#postventa" class="btn-primary">Iniciemos juntos</a>
            <a href="#linea-producto" class="btn-secondary">Ver líneas de producto</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-[30px] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-8 backdrop-blur-xl">
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-200/80">Atención al cliente</div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300">
          Dejé un panel de contacto listo para conectar más adelante con el formulario o backend que definas.
        </p>

        <form class="mt-8 grid gap-4">
          <input
            class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 outline-none transition focus:border-cyan-300/40"
            type="text"
            placeholder="Nombre"
          />
          <input
            class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 outline-none transition focus:border-cyan-300/40"
            type="text"
            placeholder="Empresa"
          />
          <input
            class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 outline-none transition focus:border-cyan-300/40"
            type="email"
            placeholder="Correo"
          />
          <textarea
            class="min-h-[130px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 outline-none transition focus:border-cyan-300/40"
            placeholder="Mensaje"
          ></textarea>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-[0_18px_50px_rgba(34,211,238,0.30)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            Iniciemos juntos
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
